<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The National Productivity Council (Incor- poration) Act 1966 may, upon the coming into force of this Act, be cited as the National Productivity Corporation (Incorporation) Act 1966."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
