<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The National Productivity Council poration) Act 1966, which in this Act is referred to as \"the principal Act\", is amended by substituting for the words \"National Productivity Council\" or \"the Council\" wherever they appear the words \"National Productivity Corporation\" or \"the Corporation\" respectively."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
