<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The \"Director of the Centre\" appointed under section 5 of the principal Act shall, after commencement of this Act, be known as \"the Director General\" and all references in any written law to \"the Director\" or \"the Director of the Centre\" shall be construed accordingly."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
