<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The change of names provided by subsections (1) and (2) shall not affect any rights or obligations of the Council or render defective any legal proceedings by or against it; and any legal proceedings that could have been continued or commenced by or against it prior to the commencement of this Act may be continued or commenced under its new name."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
