<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/name> "The principal Act is amended by inserting,"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "immediately after section 3, the following new section 3A. (1) The Minister shall, in respect of each member of the Corporation specified in section 3 (3) (c) to (g), appoint one person from the same Ministry or department as that member to be an alternate member to attend, in place of the member, meetings of the Corporation that the member is for any reason unable to attend. (2) When attending meetings of the Corporation, an alternate member shall for all purposes be deemed to be a member of the Corporation. (3) An alternate member shall, unless he sooner resigns his membership, or his appointment is sooner revoked, cease to be an alternate member when the member for whom he is an alternate member ceases to be a member.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
