<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_6__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting, immediately after subsection (1), the following new subsection (1A): \"(1A) The Corporation may appoint, on such terms and conditions as it thinks fit, such other officers and servants as it may consider necessary for carrying out the purposes of this Act.\";"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_6__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@/~cl_6> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/14/eng@> .
